:HL["https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/META-AI.jpg","image"]
18:T2d51,<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6751 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/META-INSTAGRAM.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" /></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">Have you noticed a new feature on your </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">Instagram</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> recently</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">?</span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">Yes, here we are talking about the integration of </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">an </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">AI-driven search bar on Instagram. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">This feature specifically takes incorporating AI to the next level</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> and is</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> in the testing phase.</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> It incorporates Meta’s search feature through the Lla</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">ma 3 model, which generates AI’s search by Google and Bing</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> on your </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0">Instagram</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW260592342 BCX0"> itself. </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW260592342 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6736 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240425-161148_Instagram-1-1024x210.jpg" alt="" width="660" height="135" /></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0">The existence of Artificial </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0">Intelligence (AI)</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0"> has </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0">undoubtedly </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0">emerged</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0"> and drawn its </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0">visibility in various fields serving its well-defined purpose</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266795752 BCX0"> in every way. </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW266795752 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In preceding times, the use of AI has only kept growing, and hence, the human dependence on AI has increased in day-to-day functioning. The massive popularity of <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/social-media-marketing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social media</a> applications has become a reason to empower it, with the latest updates and next-generation functions. One such is the latest Meta’s AI search update by Llama model. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">On the other hand, Instagram’s popularity and active user number are highest in India, at approximately 358.55 million. In addition to this, it became necessary</span><span data-contrast="auto"> for people to have easy access to AI features. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/top-18-ai-tools-for-video-editing-and-creation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18 Best AI Tools For Video Editing and Creation</a></p>
<h2>How to use this feature:</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">1: Update your Instagram from the Play Store.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">2: You will see the Meta’s search bar right above your chat page.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6736 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240425-161148_Instagram-1-1024x210.jpg" alt="" width="660" height="135" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">3: Another fascinating feature is that one can use AI search even in chats! </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">4: To use it in chat, just type @, and you will see options like </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6743 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240425-171037_Instagram-1-2-1024x593.jpg" alt="" width="660" height="382" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">5: Here you go, the AI features will now enhance your chats even more. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Let’s understand how to use this feature and help improve your chatting experience and online communication: </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Case test 1:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We asked </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">@Meta </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">to suggest a good </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-contrast="none">Digital Marketing Agency in Thane</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, Here’s the response. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6744 " src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240425-172953_Instagram-1-562x1024.jpg" alt="" width="281" height="512" /></p>
<h3><span class="TextRun SCXW258567589 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW258567589 BCX0">Case test 2: </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW258567589 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6745 " src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240425-173212_Instagram-1-562x1024.jpg" alt="" width="290" height="528" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In this example, we see one can share their ideas or suggestions in group chats and share the response with multiple users together, making it extremely convenient to use. Unlike switching to another application or switching to another site to get certain data. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Case test 3:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Well now your Instagram has the power to ideate too? So, suppose you&#8217;re sharing ideas with your friends or need examples to define or give clear vision you can use this AI feature without having to switch to another application. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The utmost benefit is that you can share this on group chats and connect with many people and share a sneak peek of your ideas in a creative and more simplified way. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6746 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240426-161658_Instagram-1-1024x276.jpg" alt="" width="660" height="178" /></p>
<h4><span class="TextRun SCXW207905396 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW207905396 BCX0">Result: </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW207905396 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6747 " src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240426-161706_Instagram-1-512x1024.jpg" alt="" width="291" height="582" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">One can also download the images quickly, this makes it a convenient and productive way of integrating AI features to your social media applications. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Conclusion:</h2>
<p><b><i><span data-contrast="auto">Our verdict</span></i></b><span data-contrast="auto">&#8211; So, this AI-empowered search feature has enhanced the application usage, making it more valuable and convenient. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">Impulse Digital, being a </span><span data-contrast="none">Digital Marketing Agency in Mumbai</span><span data-contrast="auto">, collaborates with clients fostering good quality digital marketing services. Thereby forming a full circle to understand the online world better and empowering our clients with more informed, creative and result-oriented solutions. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">To work with us contact us on: </span><a href="mailto:collabs@theimpulsedigital.com"><span data-contrast="none">collabs@theimpulsedigital.com</span></a> <span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
